WEBVTT

00:06:29.073 --> 00:06:30.097
I had to rest it.

00:06:30.121 --> 00:06:32.754
So I had to avoid everything
that triggered my symptoms.

00:06:32.778 --> 00:06:35.649
For me that meant no reading,
no writing, no video games,

00:06:35.673 --> 00:06:38.729
no work or email, no running,
no alcohol, no caffeine.

00:06:38.753 --> 00:06:41.722
In other words -- and I think
you see where this is going --

00:06:41.746 --> 00:06:42.826
no reason to live.

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:43.851
(Laughter)

00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:45.716
Of course it's meant to be funny,

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.634
but in all seriousness,
suicidal ideation is quite common

00:06:49.658 --> 00:06:51.303
with traumatic brain injuries.

00:06:51.621 --> 00:06:54.816
It happens to one in three,
and it happened to me.

00:06:55.243 --> 00:06:59.816
My brain started telling me,
"Jane, you want to die."